        personal tracks live on
        <a href="{{ links.soundcloud }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SoundCloud</a>.
      </p>
      {# The track list is build data (src/data/music.js) handed to the player
         through this attribute: music.js is passthrough-copied, not templated,
         so it cannot read globals itself. Single quotes because dump emits
         double ones. #}
      <ul id="music-list" class="music-list" data-tracks='{{ music | dump | safe }}'></ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
